{
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's ridiculous to think you can beat me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So frustrating."
            ]
        }
    },
    "3": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All right, it's just about time.",
                "Now, where is Gensokyo's own Great Sage, Equal to Heaven?"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm? You called?"
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is it finally time to conquer the surface?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're quick to seize an opportunity."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've recruited such a reassuring ally, and one of flesh, too.",
                "Now, let's begin."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This will be our final training session.",
                "Come at me!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, I knew you were here for a fight."
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Okay, that's enough."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I need you to work with the beast spirits to defend our territory once we've taken it."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Understood!"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then what will you do, Lady Yachie?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I will pay the Keiga Family and the Gouyoku Alliance a visit.",
                "To keep them in their lane."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm particularly interested in the Keiga Family.",
                "Their new friend looks rather capable."
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Doesn't this opportunity seem <i$too> ripe to you?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is the place from the rumors, but..."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh! With that long, scaly tail..."
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Could it <i$really> be?",
                "Matriarch Kicchou of the Kiketsu Family!?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But why would she come here?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hah, this opportunity is already ripe.",
                "You, ancient wolf pup."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let the feast begin!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Lady Saki's not going to stay quiet now you've pulled this crap!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Of course she won't."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because that's part of my plan."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, you almost frightened me."
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "As I thought, the law of the wild runs in our blood."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "An active battle really gets the blood pumping and the body jumping."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh my."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's strange to see Yachie come out here herself."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I grew tired of waiting."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've heard that you beat Enoko.",
                "Senseless, by the sound of it."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've been looking to pay it back to you. ",
                "I already have, actually."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your little monkey hermit came a-knocking, but she couldn't hold me up long.",
                "She was weaker than I expected. A disappointing showing, really."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What did you do to Biten!?"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I won't forgive you.",
                "Get ready!"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In this world, the strong trample the weak!",
                "In the end, only the cruel and ruthless will prevail!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm? Done already? Have you gotten <i$this> weak?",
                "I'm so disappointed..."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Kh—",
                "Sorry, I just couldn't focus on the fight."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did something happen?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No... it's just, why did you do it?",
                "Why Enoko...?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......"
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Looks like I was more ruthless!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I heard Yuuma also made a new friend."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How unusual for that loner."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There were a lot of reports she's here but..."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heeey, chupacabra!",
                "Are you here?"
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who's there?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not some weird youkai like",
                "a chupacabra or something!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm a tenkajin!"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, is that so?",
                "My sincere apologies, chupacajin of the Gouyoku Alliance."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To bring up the name of the Gouyoku Alliance...",
                "Just who are you?"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am the Matriarch of the Kiketsu Family,",
                "Yachie Kicchou."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, the Kiketsu Family...",
                "Now it makes sense."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was told to off any of Toutetsu's",
                "enemies without a second thought."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "|\t\t,\tThe Kiketsu Family\t,You guys",
                "The Kiketsu Family are enemies, right?",
                "<i$Right!?>"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All right, that's the game!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "As expected of the Matriarch...",
                "By the way, how do you keep your tail so glossy?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, that? Here's my secret:",
                "I'm early to bed and early to rise."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Right, I'll go to sleep early too.",
                "I'll start right now!"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "When I heard Yuuma made a new friend,",
                "I thought the world had gone mad."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But now, I get it."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What do you mean?"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You two are cut from the same cloth."
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wow, what a letdown.",
                "The Kiketsu Family head is way too weak."
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm almost done making the rounds...",
                "Yuuma Totetsu's the last on my list."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It doesn't seem like she's shown her mug in the Animal Realm lately."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I need to brace myself."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oooh,",
                "If it isn't Yachie?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You finally feel like starting."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By the way, I heard about Chiyari."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Meh. If she can't win, that's her problem."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How cold.",
                "Is that attitude appropriate for a leader?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If anything, it's a kindness.",
                "To flatter the weak into suffering for you is more cruel."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, it's not good to meddle in the policies of other groups."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Enough talk, it's high time we get to fighting."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm itching to grab that tail of yours",
                "and show off my giant swing!"
            ]
        },
        "212_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So long'a Yachie!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Game over!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll admit defeat this time."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That aside, you're acting weird."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're not the type to go out looking for a fair fight."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're quite right about that.",
                "Maybe this incident's turmoil is driving me mad, or maybe..."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, so you've noticed too.",
                "Someone is working behind our backs."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, <i$that's> a relief."
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Battle is the best spice."
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It took a lot of time, but I've finally",
                "tracked down a route here."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wherever you're hiding, come out. I have words."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To hide is an oni's duty."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What business do you have here,",
                "O Yachie Kicchou, Matriarch of the Kiketsu Family?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Funny story. You know Biten's staff?",
                "I noticed it's actually a teleportation trap."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Since she was an asset to the Family,",
                "I had figured I would let it slide."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But then, would you believe it, I found the",
                "<i$same> trap on the Keiga Family's new dog."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is that so strange? ",
                "These are dangerous times. Traps lie in wait everywhere."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The story of that monkey in the sanctuary,",
                "I first heard it when you..."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No, more than that. Only someone like you",
                "would devise such a roundabout scheme."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You'll have the three Families kill each other so <i$you> can gorge on the fruits of <i$our> labor.",
                "Are you <i$that> hungry?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmph."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You mongrels of the Animal Realm",
                "were too slow to notice."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The fruits of <i$your> labor?",
                "Don't make me laugh."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why do you worthless creatures not understand?",
                "All of it, from the very start, belonged to me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Do you wish to challenge me again,",
                "Kiketsu Yachie?"
            ]
        }
    }
}